+-- None of the three patched bodies or the four callees pinned below is one of
+-- the bodies production holds comment-stripped (docs/evidence/followup-2-
+-- production-apply-20261119/guarded/README.md and the PR 324 kit's "Function
+-- bodies, definitions and the comment-stripping drift"); production's
+-- 2026-10-22 read-back holds each at the digest pinned here, so one reviewed
+-- body is accepted for each. No table, column, constraint, artifact or
+-- wording changes.
