+-- model and an approved cloud provider. Everything else stays refused: a
+-- record the account uploaded, one it was granted, another account's own
+-- adult record, an embryo or cohort, an inactive or unbound record, a record a
+-- public appeal holds, and a second account presenting the first one's
+-- authority. A self subject resolves exactly as before.
